audbjorn fork) on host `vinbonesjr` (Ryzen 7900X3D, Intel Arc A770 16GB). Work was split across two Claude contexts (Opus 5.5 for 09-26\u219209-28, Sonnet 5.5 resumed 10-01), with the A770 driver switched from i915 to **xe** between them by other sessions.\n\n- **Major technical work:** The session covered PKGBUILD rework, a `LLAMA_SUBPROCESS` ABI compatibility trap (commit d37dd50bb), SYCL graph optimizations, a oneDNN A/B test, the oneAPI 2026.0 \u2192 2026.1 upgrade (DLE swap), PR #63 review, a DG2 XMX-gather IGC crash patch (4e7400c3a), 256-GRF kernels, and a \"12-vs-18 t/s\" decode performance investigation.\n\n- **Driver/kernel changes:** The host moved from kernel `7.3.0-rc1` (i915 driver) to `7.3.0-rc5` with the A770 bound to the **xe** driver [verified live], which was a prerequisite for later benchmarking.\n\n- **Deliverables"}